'''''Valeriana calcitrapae''''' is a species of annual herb in the family [[Caprifoliaceae]]. Individuals can grow to 18&nbsp;cm tall.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Centranthus calcitrapae (L.) Dufr. - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/49284481|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|last=Mifsud|first=Stephen|date=2002-08-23|title=Centaurium tenuiflorum (Slender Centaury) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands.|url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/GENT/Centaurium_tenuiflorum.php|access-date=2022-02-15|website=www.maltawildplants.com|language=en-us}}</ref> It is native to the [[Mediterranean Basin]], [[Crimea]], and [[Macaronesia]] (the [[Azores]], [[Canary Islands]], and [[Madeira]]).<ref name = powo/> 

